   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the Children Framework Agreement South 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida kommer ev. att ge fortsatt st&#xf6;d till R&#xe4;dda Barnens arbete i      utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r 2012.  St&#xf6;det g&#xe5;r ut p&#xe5; att R&#xe4;dda Barnen ska    st&#xe4;rka civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisation i utvecklingsl&#xe4;nder som arbetar med barns r&#xe4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida might give continued support to SCS work in the south for 2012.  The aim of the support is to strenghten CSOs in developing countries  that works with children&apos;s rights.</narrative>
  </description>
